<section id="what-id-want-to-see-next" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="what-id-want-to-see-next">What I’d want to see next</h2>
<p>An SAE paper that reports, for its headline features, the ablation effect size alongside the interpretability score. Right now those two numbers rarely appear in the same table.</p>
</section>
